# Quran Navigation Enhancements: Juz', Hizb, Rub', and Sajdah Indicators

This plan details the implementation of comprehensive Quranic divisions and annotations:
1. **Juz' (الجزء)** & **Hizb (الحزب)** & **Rub' (ربع الحزب)** in-reader decorative division banners.
2. **Sajdah (سجدة التلاوة ۩)** visual badges and interactive Du'a bottom sheet.
3. **Juz' Browser Tab** on the main Quran screen ([`QuranListScreen.kt`](file:///d:/AI/Projects%20With%20AI/Islamic%20App/Muslim%20Companion%20V1/muslim-companion/app/src/main/java/com/example/ui/screens/QuranListScreen.kt)) allowing direct navigation by the 30 Juz'.
4. **Reader Header Subtitle** indicating the current Juz' and Hizb dynamically.

---

## User Review Required

> [!NOTE]
> All underlying data calculations (240 quarters, 60 hizbs, 30 juz', and 15 sajdahs) run **100% offline** with $O(1)$ lookup time using the existing [`MadaniDataSource`](file:///d:/AI/Projects%20With%20AI/Islamic%20App/Muslim%20Companion%20V1/muslim-companion/app/src/main/java/com/example/data/quran/MadaniDataSource.kt). No network or database migration is required.

