    - `getJuzAndHizbForAyah(surah: Int, ayah: Int): Pair<Int, Int>`
    - `ALL_30_JUZ: List<JuzInfo>` (Complete metadata for all 30 Juz').
    - `ALL_15_SAJDAHS: List<SajdahInfo>` (Complete 15 Sajdah positions).

